cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Brain-to-Text: Hybrid LSTM-Transformer CTC Decoder with KenLM + LLM Rescoring"
abstract: >-
  A neural-speech decoding pipeline for the Kaggle brain-to-text-25 competition:
  a hybrid CNN + BiLSTM + patch-Transformer acoustic model trained with phoneme
  CTC, decoded with a lexicon-constrained KenLM 4-gram beam search, and rescored
  with a verbatim-conditioned Qwen2.5-7B language model via margin-adaptive score
  fusion. Validation WER 7.62% / CER 5.31% / PER 12.12%.
authors:
  - family-names: Biswas
    given-names: Anik
keywords:
  - brain-computer-interface
  - speech-decoding
  - CTC
  - transformer
  - KenLM
  - LLM-rescoring
